openpci-rtl8029.device
======================

SANA-II network driver for RTL8029 (NE2000 compatible) PCI Ethernet cards
on classic AmigaOS (m68k), using openpci.library.

Contents

  Install                               installer, double-click to run
  openpci-rtl8029.guide                 documentation (driver, tools)
  Devs/Networks/openpci-rtl8029.device  the driver
  C/client                              network test client
  C/s2stat                              shows the driver's counters
  Licenses/                             license texts

Requirements

  openpci.library from the openpci package (Aminet driver/other/
  openpci68k.lha).

